WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.095 --> 00:00:02.696
(piano music)

00:00:02.696 --> 00:00:07.367
- [Narrator] This is Rainbow,
a red-sided eclectus parrot.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:10.423
That deep green plumage,
with a tint of blue,

00:00:10.423 --> 00:00:13.927
signifies that Rainbow is a male bird.

00:00:13.927 --> 00:00:17.059
Female eclectuses have deep red feathers,

00:00:17.059 --> 00:00:19.784
and until the 20th
century, males and females

00:00:19.784 --> 00:00:22.840
were considered different species.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.767
Native to Papua New Guinea,
these beautiful birds

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:28.861
nest high up in the tropical rainforests.

00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:32.030
They are considered to be
extremely intelligent birds.

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:35.819
And amongst the best in
talking ability for parrots.

00:00:35.819 --> 00:00:38.016
Their vocal skills and stunning plumage

00:00:38.016 --> 00:00:41.469
have made them highly
desirable in the pet trade.

00:00:41.469 --> 00:00:44.395
While logging and other
forms of habitat destruction,

00:00:44.395 --> 00:00:47.811
have caused their population
to decline steadily.

00:00:47.811 --> 00:00:50.978
This is the red-sided eclectus parrot.

